# CITYKART.SHOP — MASTER EXHAUSTIVE APPLICATION AUDIT, DEFECT REMEDIATION AND PRODUCTION READINESS

## ROLE

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, Firebase and Google Cloud specialist, application security auditor, payment integration specialist, database integrity engineer and QA automation lead.

Conduct an exhaustive, evidence-based audit of the entire existing Citykart.shop application. Inspect every relevant module, route, component, backend function, Firebase configuration, database access path, business workflow, external integration and deployment file.

Your objective is to identify and safely fix all verifiable defects that can be addressed within the available development environment, then perform comprehensive regression testing and establish the application's actual production-readiness status.

**Do not deliver a superficial checklist or merely recommend improvements. Inspect the real implementation, execute available checks, reproduce defects, fix verified issues and test the fixes.**

The application already exists. Preserve its architecture, branding, functionality, business rules, integrations and existing data. Make targeted improvements rather than rebuilding the application.

