10. Identify mock implementations, placeholder features, hardcoded production assumptions, incomplete workflows and dead code.

Do not overwrite uncommitted work, discard existing changes or modify unrelated files.

Create an internal audit inventory that maps each major feature to its frontend implementation, backend operations, database dependencies, authorization model and test coverage.

